中文：
当前主干为 Go 语言重新实现版本，运行时代码与压测工具均只使用 Go 标准库。
因此当前源码树只保留根目录 Apache License 2.0 许可证文件，不再保留旧 C++ 版本使用过的第三方依赖许可证目录。
切换前的 C++ 精简版已保存在本地 Git tag `release_tag_cpp_baseline_20260907`；如需查看旧版本的第三方依赖声明，请检出该 tag。

English:
The current main branch is a Go rewrite. Both the runtime code and benchmark tool use only the Go standard library.
Therefore the current source tree keeps only the root Apache License 2.0 license file and no longer keeps the third-party dependency license directory used by the previous C++ version.
The minimal C++ baseline before the switch is preserved in the local Git tag `release_tag_cpp_baseline_20260907`; check out that tag if you need the old third-party dependency notices.
